Poison is terrible in vanilla. Eat everything you can that *might*
convey poison resistance, and when you get it, lift something really
heavy and #pray. Your god will heal the strength loss. And before you
get it, find some cloak, even an AC 0 dwarvish cloak, and *wear it*
for moderate protection.


